<span begin="00:23.930" end="00:24.650">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.950" end="00:28.790"><span begin="00:24.950" end="00:25.280">Than </span><span begin="00:25.280" end="00:25.490">the </span><span begin="00:25.490" end="00:25.880">thoughts </span><span begin="00:25.880" end="00:26.090">of </span><span begin="00:26.090" end="00:26.300">you </span><span begin="00:26.300" end="00:26.630">that </span><span begin="00:26.630" end="00:26.750">I </span><span begin="00:26.750" end="00:27.050">should </span><span begin="00:27.050" end="00:27.350">not </span><span begin="00:27.350" end="00:27.590">be </span><span begin="00:27.590" end="00:28.550">thinking</span><span begin="00:28.550" end="00:28.790">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.790" end="00:30.440"><span begin="00:28.790" end="00:29.120">When </span><span begin="00:29.120" end="00:29.330">I'm </span><span begin="00:29.330" end="00:29.540">with </span><span begin="00:29.540" end="00:30.200">someone </span><span begin="00:30.200" end="00:30.440">else</span><span begin="00:30.440" end="00:30.440">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.440" end="00:32.990"><span begin="00:30.440" end="00:30.650">It's </span><span begin="00:30.650" end="00:31.160">feeling </span><span begin="00:31.160" end="00:31.520">like </span><span begin="00:31.520" end="00:31.670">I'm </span><span begin="00:31.670" end="00:32.990">cheating</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.080" end="00:36.450"><span begin="00:33.080" end="00:33.680">I </span><span begin="00:33.680" end="00:34.220">just </span><span begin="00:34.220" end="00:34.700">might </span><span begin="00:34.700" end="00:35.180">go </span><span begin="00:35.180" end="00:35.600">off </span><span begin="00:35.600" end="00:35.690">the </span><span begin="00:35.690" end="00:36.090">deep </span><span begin="00:36.090" end="00:36.450">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.470" end="00:40.520"><span begin="00:36.470" end="00:36.680">When </span><span begin="00:36