lf</span><span begin="00:54.260" end="00:54.260">, </span><span begin="00:54.260" end="00:55.010">no</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.480" end="00:58.640"><span begin="00:56.480" end="00:56.840">When </span><span begin="00:56.840" end="00:57.020">I </span><span begin="00:57.020" end="00:57.380">have </span><span begin="00:57.380" end="00:57.560">you</span><span begin="00:57.560" end="00:57.560">, </span><span begin="00:57.560" end="00:58.040">wanna </span><span begin="00:58.040" end="00:58.400">leave </span><span begin="00:58.400" end="00:58.640">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.640" end="01:00.620"><span begin="00:58.640" end="00:58.880">If </span><span begin="00:58.880" end="00:59.060">you </span><span begin="00:59.060" end="00:59.360">go</span><span begin="00:59.360" end="00:59.360">, </span><span begin="00:59.360" end="00:59.630">that's </span><span begin="00:59.630" end="00:59.900">when </span><span begin="00:59.900" end="01:00.050">I </span><span begin="01:00.050" end="01:00.380">need </span><span begin="01:00.380" end="01:00.620">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.620" end="01:03.140"><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.830">I </span><span begin="01:00.830" end="01:01.160">can't </span><span begin="01:01.160" end="01:01.520">help </span><span begin="01:01.520" end="01:02.390">myself</span><span begin="01:02.390" end="01:02.390">, </span><span begin="01:02.390" end="01:03.140">no</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.470" end="01:08.300"><span begin="01:03.470" end="01:04.160">You </span><span begin="01:04.160" end="01:04.730">come </span><span begin="01:04.730" end="01:05.180">in </span><span begin="01:05.180" end="01:06.770">waves</span><span begin="01:06.770" end="01:06.770">, </span><span begin="01:06.770" end="01:07.220">waves</span><span begin="01:07.220" end="01:07.760">, </span><span begin="01:07.760" end="01:08.300">waves</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.660" end="01:18.770"><span begin="01:11.660" end="01:12.35